# MemNet + Multitask Mode

Load in-repo skill **`memnet-multitask`** (`.cursor/skills/memnet-multitask/SKILL.md`). Product ops SSOT: `docs/operations/multi-agent-sessions.md`. System-repo pattern: `docs/application-notes/system/llm-system-dev-multitask.md`. Chat is never mission SSOT. Product shape: `docs/SHAPE.md`.

## MUST

- One shared session id; **TCP serve** or **streamable-http** MCP (not in-process stdio).
- Parent: mint/settle `TSK_*` / `USR_*`; end turn after delegate; `pin_map` on next coordinator turn.
- Workers: cue then `pin_map` first; mutate only under assigned subgraph.

## MUST NOT

- Treat chat as durable state; poll workers; assume full ACL modes / `session_token`.
- Treat RSV or Path-B ingest as unshipped — they are shipped. CapsPolicy ACL is off by default (ships when enabled).
- Snap-on-session / `rag_query`; dump \(S\) into a worker prompt.
